  "historyNote": "#3096, eff 8-19-85; EXPIRED: 8-19-91 New. #4708, eff 12-1-89, EXPIRED: 12-1-95 New. #7133, eff 11-23-99; ss by #7559, eff 9-25-01; ss by #9520, eff 8-4-09; amd by #10641, eff 7-18-14 paras (a), and (c) – (i) EXPIRED: 8-4-18 New. #13035, EMERGENCY, eff 4-14-20, EXPIRES: 10-11-20; ss by #13108, eff 9-22-20; ss by #14637, eff 6-26-26, EXPIRES: 6-26-36",
